values ('c1d2e3f4-5a6b-4c61-8d01-1e2f3a4b5c31', 'research-methods-in-political-science', 'Research Methods in Political Science', 'Frame political science as systematic inquiry into power, institutions, behavior, policy, conflict, representation, and governance. Topics cover theory and hypotheses, research design and causal logic, measurement, data sources and reproducible workflow, case studies, process tracing, interviews and fieldwork, surveys, experiments, regression, content analysis and text-as-data, mixed methods, ethics and open science, and a research proposal or replication portfolio.');

